cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ddi-l: a Python toolkit for DDI Lifecycle 3.3 XML documents"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bisson
    given-names: Philippe
repository-code: "https://github.com/pbisson44/ddi-l"
url: "https://github.com/pbisson44/ddi-l"
abstract: >-
  ddi-l is a Python library and command-line tool for creating, reading,
  updating, and validating DDI Lifecycle 3.3 XML documents. Its model layer is
  generated from the official DDI XML Schemas, and the DDI 3.1, 3.2, and 3.3
  schemas are bundled so validation works offline.
keywords:
  - DDI
  - DDI Lifecycle
  - metadata
  - survey
  - XML
  - official statistics
  - data documentation
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-08"
